<title>POLAND: Budimex wins PLN 188.2 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Budimex wins PLN 188.2 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>GDANSK, Poland 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Budimex SA has won a tender for building a part of the sewage treatment plant in Gdansk, northern Poland, worth 188.2 million zlotys, the city's deputy president said.</p>
<p>&quot;The management of the city approved the choice ..., Budimex's offer was the cheapest one,&quot; Longin Majewski told Reuters.</p>
<p>He said the deal would be finalised later this month and work on the construction would be carried out in the next three years.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
